Licences for data/
==================

This directory mixes material created for this study with material obtained
from third parties. They are licensed differently.

Created for this study — CC BY 4.0
----------------------------------
  manuscripts/    the five manuscripts MS-A .. MS-E
  groundtruth/    the seeded defects and their anchors
  figures/        the figure stimuli for the vision task
  t3/, t4/, t8/   the item sets for those tasks

  Copyright (c) 2026 Haruka Ozaki, released under the Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 International licence. https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Obtained from third parties — original licence applies
------------------------------------------------------
  guidelines/     a journal's Instructions for Authors
  preprints/      the text of a published preprint
  reviews/        the published peer reviews of that preprint

  These are redistributed under the terms of their sources, which are recorded
  with retrieval date and SHA-256 in PROVENANCE.md. They are included so that
  the reported measurements can be reproduced against the material actually
  used: these sources are revised over time, so a URL alone would not identify
  what was measured.

  If you are a rights holder and object to redistribution here, please contact
  ai-biology@ml.riken.jp and it will be removed.
